+`--require-fresh` requires a synchronized `capture_time_unix` in the image
+packet and waits for an image captured after settling. Collector and publisher
+must share a synchronized wall clock. Repeated `buffer=False` reads alone can
+return cached frames. `--refine-template` aligns the marker's interior code cells
+to avoid switching between its black square and the surrounding border; failed
+alignments are rejected. Use the same option for held-out checks.
